# Marketplace Legal

# Purpose

The Legal repository is the Marketplace's legal, compliance, governance, and policy source of truth.

# Responsibilities

- Marketplace Terms
- Customer Terms
- Professional Terms
- Privacy Policy
- Cookie Policy
- Payment Terms
- Escrow Policy
- Refund Policy
- Withdrawal Policy
- Dispute Policy
- Safety Policies
- Communication, call, and masked-number policies
- Professional Verification Policy
- Data Protection and Privacy requirements
- GDPR and NDPA requirements
- Regional compliance requirements
- Security and incident policies
- Intellectual Property policies
- Admin governance
- Contracts and legal templates
- Legal review and policy version history

# Integration

- customer-app → customer terms, privacy, cookies, refunds
- professional-app → professional terms, verification, withdrawals, service rules
- admin-dashboard → admin governance and compliance
- payment-service → payment, escrow, refund, withdrawal policies
- communication-service → communication, calls, masked-number and retention policies
- notification-service → consent and communication preferences
- database → retention and data-protection requirements
- security → security and incident requirements

# Boundaries

This repository contains legal and compliance documentation only.

It does NOT contain application code, backend logic, database schemas, UI/UX, payment processing, authentication, Twilio implementation, or infrastructure configuration.

# Global Compliance

Support applicable requirements across countries, including GDPR, NDPA, and regional regulations.

# Change Management

Legal changes require versioning, effective dates, review, approval, and change history.

